{"title": "Booze Remedy", "pageid": 28512, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Booze_Remedy", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Booze Remedy</b> is a passive feature that keeps the wearer drunk for longer and lets them regain health.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While wearing this amulet, regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> per turn while <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alcohol_(Condition)\" title=\"Alcohol (Condition)\">Drunk</a>. Additionally, increase the duration of your inebriation by 5 rounds. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Drunkard\" title=\"Amulet of the Drunkard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Amulet_Necklace_A_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_the_Drunkard\" title=\"Amulet of the Drunkard\">Amulet of the Drunkard</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The initial tick of healing applies immediately, in or out of combat; healing over time only applies in combat.</li>\n<li>Booze Remedy also works with the unique <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Drunken_Master\" title=\"Way of the Drunken Master\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Class_Monk_Drunken_Master_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Monk_Drunken_Master_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Class_Monk_Drunken_Master_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Monk_Drunken_Master_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/49/Class_Monk_Drunken_Master_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Monk_Drunken_Master_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Way of the Drunken Master\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/49/Class_Monk_Drunken_Master_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Monk_Drunken_Master_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/49/Class_Monk_Drunken_Master_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_the_Drunken_Master\" title=\"Way of the Drunken Master\">Way of the Drunken Master</a> version of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Drunken_Master)_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Drunken Master) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Drunk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Alcohol_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Drunk_(Drunken_Master)_(Condition)\" title=\"Drunk (Drunken Master) (Condition)\">Drunk</a>. With the duration increase from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cheeky_Tipple\" title=\"Cheeky Tipple\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/20px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/30px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/40px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cheeky Tipple\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp/20px-Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Cheeky_Tipple_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cheeky_Tipple\" title=\"Cheeky Tipple\">Cheeky Tipple</a> and this passive, a single alcohol consumable lasts for 10 rounds.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202113\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2122/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19283/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7439/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 969671/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   61.224      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   61.224      1 -total\n 25.26%   15.464      5 Template:Icon_text\n 23.68%   14.498     20 Template:Trim\n 23.54%   14.411      1 Template:Passive_equipment_li